+          "Solve using Gaussian elimination: $$\\begin{cases} x + 2y + z = 45 \\\\ 2x + y + z = 55 \\\\ x + y + 2z = 40 \\end{cases}$$",
+        ),
+        answer: { kind: "multiple-choice", options: rng.shuffle(options) },
